PYGLET TESTS
============

This is my personal tests for pyglet in prevision of the J3D project.

How to run it
=============

With devenv installed
---------------------

$ devenv allow
$ devenv shell
$ uv run main.py	

Without devenv installed
------------------------

Requirements :
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

* Python (https://www.python.org/downloads/)
* Uv (https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/)

1- Install :
~~~~~~~~~~~~

$ uv sync

2- Run :
~~~~~~~~

$ uv run main.py
